    <content>
      <![CDATA[<div class="lang-block" data-lang="zh"><p>这篇是写给我自己看的备忘录：这套博客是怎么组起来的，以后想改哪里该去哪个文件。</p><h2 id="技术栈"><a href="#技术栈" class="headerlink" title="技术栈"></a>技术栈</h2><table><thead><tr><th>部分</th><th>选择</th><th>原因</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>生成器</td><td>Hexo 7</td><td>Node 生态，模板就是 EJS，改起来直观</td></tr><tr><td>主题</td><td>warm（自己写的）</td><td>想要暖色调 + 真正的中英切换</td></tr><tr><td>托管</td><td>GitHub Pages</td><td>免费、稳定、自定义域名也支持</td></tr><tr><td>搜索</td><td>hexo-generator-searchdb</td><td>纯前端，不需要服务器</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="目录结构"><a href="#目录结构" class="headerlink" title="目录结构"></a>目录结构</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">blog/</span><br><span class="line">├── _config.yml          <span class="comment"># 站点配置：标题、作者、URL、部署</span></span><br><span class="line">├── scripts/</span><br><span class="line">│   └── tag-lang.js      <span class="comment"># 双语标签插件</span></span><br><span class="line">├── <span class="built_in">source</span>/</span><br><span class="line">│   ├── _posts/          <span class="comment"># 文章都放这里</span></span><br><span class="line">│   ├── about/           <span class="comment"># 关于页</span></span><br><span class="line">│   ├── tags/            <span class="comment"># 标签总览页</span></span><br><span class="line">│   └── search/          <span class="comment"># 搜索页</span></span><br><span class="line">└── themes/warm/</span><br><span class="line">    ├── _config.yml      <span class="comment"># 主题配置：菜单、问候语、头像</span></span><br><span class="line">    ├── layout/          <span class="comment"># EJS 模板</span></span><br><span class="line">    └── <span class="built_in">source</span>/          <span class="comment"># css / js / images</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="写一篇新文章"><a href="#写一篇新文章" class="headerlink" title="写一篇新文章"></a>写一篇新文章</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> blog</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo new post <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后打开 <code>source/_posts/</code> 下新生成的文件，用双语标签把内容分开写：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% lang zh %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">这里是中文内容，可以正常用 Markdown。</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% endlang %&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;% lang en %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">English content here. Markdown works as usual.</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% endlang %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>页面上只会显示当前选中的那一种语言；右上角的按钮负责切换，选择会记在浏览器里。</p><h2 id="本地预览"><a href="#本地预览" class="headerlink" title="本地预览"></a>本地预览</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>打开 <a href="http://localhost:4000/">http://localhost:4000</a> ，改完存盘刷新就行。</p><h2 id="发布上线"><a href="#发布上线" class="headerlink" title="发布上线"></a>发布上线</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo clean &amp;&amp; npx hexo generate    <span class="comment"># 生成静态文件到 public/</span></span><br><span class="line">./deploy.sh                            <span class="comment"># 提交并推送到 GitHub Pages</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>推送之后等一两分钟，<code>https://natsumxd.github.io</code> 就会更新。</p><h2 id="想改外观时"><a href="#想改外观时" class="headerlink" title="想改外观时"></a>想改外观时</h2><ul><li>颜色、字号、间距：<code>themes/warm/source/css/style.css</code> 顶部的 <code>:root</code> 变量</li><li>导航菜单、首页问候语：<code>themes/warm/_config.yml</code></li><li>站点标题、作者、社交链接：<code>blog/_config.yml</code></li></ul></div><div class="lang-block" data-lang="en"><p>A note to future me: how this blog is put together, and which file to open when I want to change something.</p><h2 id="The-stack"><a href="#The-stack" class="headerlink" title="The stack"></a>The stack</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Piece</th><th>Choice</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Generator</td><td>Hexo 7</td><td>Node ecosystem, templates are plain EJS, easy to tweak</td></tr><tr><td>Theme</td><td>warm (hand-written)</td><td>Warm palette plus a real bilingual switch</td></tr><tr><td>Hosting</td><td>GitHub Pages</td><td>Free, stable, custom domains supported</td></tr><tr><td>Search</td><td>hexo-generator-searchdb</td><td>Pure front-end, no server needed</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="Directory-layout"><a href="#Directory-layout" class="headerlink" title="Directory layout"></a>Directory layout</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">blog/</span><br><span class="line">├── _config.yml          <span class="comment"># site config: title, author, URL, deploy</span></span><br><span class="line">├── scripts/</span><br><span class="line">│   └── tag-lang.js      <span class="comment"># the bilingual tag plugin</span></span><br><span class="line">├── <span class="built_in">source</span>/</span><br><span class="line">│   ├── _posts/          <span class="comment"># posts live here</span></span><br><span class="line">│   ├── about/           <span class="comment"># about page</span></span><br><span class="line">│   ├── tags/            <span class="comment"># tag overview</span></span><br><span class="line">│   └── search/          <span class="comment"># search page</span></span><br><span class="line">└── themes/warm/</span><br><span class="line">    ├── _config.yml      <span class="comment"># theme config: menu, greeting, avatar</span></span><br><span class="line">    ├── layout/          <span class="comment"># EJS templates</span></span><br><span class="line">    └── <span class="built_in">source</span>/          <span class="comment"># css / js / images</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="Writing-a-new-post"><a href="#Writing-a-new-post" class="headerlink" title="Writing a new post"></a>Writing a new post</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> blog</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo new post <span class="string">&quot;Post title&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Then open the new file in <code>source/_posts/</code> and split the content by language:</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% lang zh %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">Chinese content here. Regular Markdown works.</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% endlang %&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;% lang en %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">English content here.</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% endlang %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Only the active language is displayed; the button in the header switches it and remembers the choice.</p><h2 id="Preview-locally"><a href="#Preview-locally" class="headerlink" title="Preview locally"></a>Preview locally</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Open <a href="http://localhost:4000/">http://localhost:4000</a> and refresh after each save.</p><h2 id="Publishing"><a href="#Publishing" class="headerlink" title="Publishing"></a>Publishing</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo clean &amp;&amp; npx hexo generate    <span class="comment"># build into public/</span></span><br><span class="line">./deploy.sh                            <span class="comment"># commit and push to GitHub Pages</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>One or two minutes after the push, <code>https://natsumxd.github.io</code> updates.</p><h2 id="Where-to-tweak-the-look"><a href="#Where-to-tweak-the-look" class="headerlink" title="Where to tweak the look"></a>Where to tweak the look</h2><ul><li>Colors, type scale, spacing: the <code>:root</code> variables at the top of <code>themes/warm/source/css/style.css</code></li><li>Menu, hero greeting: <code>themes/warm/_config.yml</code></li><li>Site title, author, social links: <code>blog/_config.yml</code></li></ul></div>]]>
